WEBVTT

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:12.650
<i>At the tournament to select the 
next Tenshi, the Raten Taishou,</i>

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:20.080
<i>outsiders gathered from all over 
the country and fought fiercely.</i>

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.700
<i>Those after the tournament's rewards...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.620
<i>Those wishing to test their own strength...</i>

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.330
<i>Those seeking revenge...</i>

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.430
<i>Those with secret and mysterious goals...</i>

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.890
<i>Amid this jumble of intentions,</i>

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.720
<i>Chou Soran defeated the powerful 
opponents standing in his way</i>

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:46.200
<i>and used every method at his disposal 
to make it to the final round.</i>

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:54.230
<i>His opponent was the Tenshi's 
disciple, Chou Reigyoku.</i>

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:59.830
<i>During an intense battle 
that pit Soran's Yougorai</i>

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.560
<i>against Reigyoku's Ingorai, 
Reigyoku suddenly collapsed,</i>

00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:08.570
<i>and the match ended abruptly.</i>

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:16.520
<i>However, even that outcome 
was planned by the Tenshi.</i>

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.680
<i>Meanwhile, Rikukin and his disciples,</i>

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:26.160
<i>who were wary of an attack by 
the hostile organization Zensei,</i>

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>and Express Delivery Company 
executives Jo San and Jo Yon</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:35.010
<i>continued to guard Ryuukosan even 
after the tournament ended.</i>

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.430
<i>After learning of Zensei's 
suspicious movements,</i>

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:45.880
<i>Jo San and Jo Yon left Soran and 
Houhou to head to the scene.</i>

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:52.330
<i>Meanwhile, Soran was about to 
learn the way of the Tenshi,</i>

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:55.040
<i>the sign marking him as 
the Tenshi's successor.</i>

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:33.730
<b>17: Way of               the Tenshi</b>

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.800
Follow me, Soran.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:50.160
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:43.380
I will now teach you the way of the Tenshi.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.420
Miss, you can't come with us.

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:56.490
Hou-nee, it'll be fine.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.970
I'll be back soon. Don't worry.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:00.870
Okay.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.690
I can't believe that shameless 
cheater actually won.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:26.390
Is he really going to become the Tenshi?

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.440
Uh...

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:33.380
The tournament's over.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.840
Are you lost?

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:39.260
We can show you the way.

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.460
No, thank you.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:45.780
It seems the Raten Taishou has ended...

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.350
But we haven't had enough fun yet.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.190
Are you...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.190
Zensei?

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.710
<i>Zhu Sha Zhang?</i>

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.560
<i>Seems like quite a skilled user.</i>

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.340
Shinjin Reigyoku.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.900
Why are you walking around 
alone so late at night?

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:40.350
Were you planning on practicing the 
secret art you recently acquired?

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:47.250
You weren't showing yourselves. 
I isolated myself so you would.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.250
I see, I see.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:53.790
You're as considerate as 
always, shinjin Reigyoku.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:57.930
We're not interested in 
giving you trouble, either.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:01.060
Hand over the Tsuutenroku.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.250
Master?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:21.970
As promised, I earned the 
right to succeed the Tenshi.

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:26.060
Tell me the truth about the Koushin War.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:33.110
Soran, what kind of person do you
think is fit to become the Tenshi?

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:33.950
Huh?

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:38.300
The strongest person on Ryuukosan?

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.690
The most cunning?

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:45.560
Or the most popular?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.200
Master...

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:50.100
The answer is simple:

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:56.550
the one chosen by the previous Tenshi 
is the most suitable candidate.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:07:04.370
And being chosen doesn't mean 
verbally or by solemn rituals.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.430
It's the previous Tenshi

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:11.190
teaching the secret art of the 
way of the Tenshi to his successor.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.110
Chou Soran.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:17.850
Tonight, I will teach you 
the way of the Tenshi.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:24.130
From this moment forward, you are 
officially the successor to the Tenshi.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:36.690
What do you want?

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.300
We are Zensei.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.600
My name is En Tou.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:47.320
We searched your room, but we 
couldn't find the Tsuutenroku.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:50.980
It seems you have it with you.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.620
A copy will do.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:57.350
Once you give it to us, 
we'll stop following you.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:58.400
How does that sound?

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.070
Hey, En-san.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:03.270
Don't go making decisions without us.

00:08:03.270 --> 00:08:06.050
If he agrees to go along with your plan,

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.450
we won't have a reason to fight him anymore.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:11.380
Let's pick up where we 
left off, Chou Reigyoku!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.850
Your Zhu Sha Zhang is impressive.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:19.970
However...

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.140
You still have a lot to learn.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:31.350
I would guess you've trained for at least 
ten years. Is that the best you can do?

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.750
My hand...

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:40.560
Why can't I use it?

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:43.940
What's going on?!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.340
Unbelievable.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:48.330
You don't know your place, youngster.

00:08:48.330 --> 00:08:51.390
Since you touched his Suizourai earlier,

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:54.630
negative ki has been 
encroaching on your body.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.570
Well, shinjin Reigyoku?

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.510
Have you considered my offer?

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:08.280
So you refuse.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:10.700
Listen up, boys.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:17.060
If you're not confident in your abilities, 
don't let his Suizourai touch you.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:19.840
Move around it. Got it?

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:23.210
Especially you, Kan Tan.

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:26.490
Heh, heh. Is Suizourai fun?

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:27.290
En-san, it's coming!

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:36.310
<i>Not even Kinkouju can block my 
Suizourai, but he deflected it?</i>

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:41.130
<i>It's not possible for such 
a technique to exist.</i>

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:49.070
If you want to capture bandits, 
go for the leader, huh?

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:55.870
All right. Show the shinjin
Reigyoku what you can do.

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:57.490
Wait, En Tou.

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:03.570
I had no idea you wanted 
the Tsuutenroku, too.

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:07.490
You're a bunch of adults 
ganging up on one young man.

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.840
Have you no shame?

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:14.250
Rikukin-senpai, it's been a while.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:18.100
My father misses you from beyond the grave.

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:23.090
I'll be going to see him soon.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.750
But first...

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:39.640
I need to take out you Zensei fiends.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:51.570
Looks like we're the ones who were set up.

00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:57.460
No matter. Now that Rikukin-senpai's 
here, we can't waste time.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.550
Retreat!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:05.710
Reigyoku, follow me.

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:09.130
We'll split up and go after them.

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:09.850
Roger.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.810
Zouryuu, keep an eye on him.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.250
O-Okay...

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.490
Stop!

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:57.600
You're not getting away!

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.030
Take this!

00:12:11.970 --> 00:12:13.220
Bastard...

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.600
You're a Gentou user, aren't you?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.740
Lucky me.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:25.880
If I hadn't watched your match, 
you would've hit me with that blow.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:30.940
You're vibrating that short sword 
at super high speed, aren't you?

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:38.940
The high speed vibrations make the 
blade appear to be an illusion.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:42.700
It can cut through even 
the strongest alloy like tofu.

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.200
My ragged pennant could never block that.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:59.120
<i>The masked man didn't fight properly in his 
match, so I don't know how strong he is.</i>

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.030
<i>He doesn't seem too unusual.</i>

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:06.630
I can probably handle him.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.830
Sorry I'm late.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.190
Be careful, Kumo!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.260
His pennant is poisoned!

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:18.520
I know.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:25.660
I knew something was up with that staff 
when one of my blows didn't shatter it!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.080
Ryoutenshaku!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.350
I see...

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:52.350
Those swords are actually tools 
to amplify your ki, aren't they?

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.430
I see.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:58.230
You're a transmuter.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:01.860
And you seem to be a necromancer.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:08.060
You summoned spirits into your 
staff to block my Ryoutenshaku.

00:14:08.060 --> 00:14:10.550
I'm not so sure.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:14.030
I don't know if I'm a necromancer.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:17.460
I was born with this power.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.020
Hey, shorty.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:19.720
What?!

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:24.780
Don't worry. You weren't poisoned.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:27.360
You just touched the ki of the dead.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:33.470
I've been polishing this pennant 
with oils taken from corpses.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:45.480
Transmuter, you're lucky you didn't 
go after En-san or Kan Tan.

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:48.470
I'm a simple mourner.

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:54.620
I'm not nearly as strong 
as geniuses like them.

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:16.130
Chou Soran!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:20.570
Where are you going, Chou Soran?

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.370
You're sure you won't let us go?

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:28.320
Slime is fun!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.030
Give it up, En Tou.

00:15:32.030 --> 00:15:36.980
Rikukin-sama, what kind 
of kung fu is he using?

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.890
I have no idea.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:44.450
There's no such thing as a style 
that can block my Suizourai.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.820
He's not using kung fu.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:55.180
It's the power of his rosary 
that's blocking your Suizourai.

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.380
En Tou is a Zensei enchanter.

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.610
An enchanter?

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.610
It's not surprising you don't know.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:06.800
Even when I was young, 
enchanters were uncommon.

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:13.490
Since ancient times, people have trained 
by infusing objects with their ki.

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:20.190
Those with total control over those 
objects were called weapon masters.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:26.370
Those who used their tools to amplify 
their power were called transmuters.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:31.540
And those who granted their 
tools unique properties

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:36.170
by imbuing them with ki 
were called enchanters.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:43.360
The various legendary weapons were 
mostly created by enchanters.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:48.350
But being an enchanter 
requires absolute skill.

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:51.250
Just knowing how to do it isn't enough.

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.900
You could say it's a technique that combines 
innate talent with learned skill.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:59.380
As a result, very few people 
can use the technique.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:01.200
I see.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:06.620
You're making me uneasy 
with your high praise.

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:10.770
You blocked his Suizourai using Chifunju,

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:14.520
a weapon said to block any and all attacks.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.400
But both people and weapons 
have their limits.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.640
Show us what you can do.

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:26.100
You shouldn't underestimate me.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.120
You're first!

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.430
He's fast.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.180
It's heavy.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:10.280
Good, that's it.

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:13.730
If you can't control it with strength, 
turn it aside using flexibility.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.720
Your body flows like water.

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:21.370
I couldn't kill you even with 
both Hakukaju and Chouhouju.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.140
A smoke screen.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.260
He found me.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:04.000
Not bad.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:10.700
You evaded my attack while your vision 
was blocked, and even counterattacked.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:13.620
I see.

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:16.770
The moment the smoke screen went up,

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:21.720
you dispelled your Ingorai and 
spread it around yourself.

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:27.520
You sacrificed defense in 
order to detect my rosary.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.730
Fantastic.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:37.630
I haven't seen such a talented 
youngster in a long time.

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:42.020
It's not that I don't understand 
the joy of raising youngsters.

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:50.050
But for me, crushing promising 
young sprouts is far more fun!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:54.830
<i>This old man is stronger than me.</i>

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.240
<i>What would Chou Soran do?</i>

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:01.910
Hey, you old fart. You're strong, right?

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:05.190
Wouldn't you rather fight 
another strong man?

00:20:05.190 --> 00:20:09.360
This old dude is way stronger 
than me. Fight him instead.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:12.640
Rikukin-sama, get him.

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:14.560
<i>I can't do that.</i>

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:22.930
<i>Sometimes I'm forced to admit 
it'd be easier to be shameless.</i>

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:27.310
<i>All I can do is fight fair and square.</i>

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:32.860
<i>My opponent is strong, 
but he's not beyond my reach.</i>

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:37.580
<i>The effectiveness of his 
wall has been weakening.</i>

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:43.210
<i>The more orbs he uses, 
the more his ki is divided,</i>

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.230
<i>weakening their effects.</i>

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:46.930
<i>In that case...</i>

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:03.100
You absorbed the vibrations of my Horouju.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:06.610
Your Suizourai is an obnoxious 
technique to deal with.

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:11.750
Looks like I can't be stingy with you.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.410
I'll use all of them at once!

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:18.850
<i>Not bad, Reigyoku.</i>

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:23.010
<i>By fighting defensively, you forced 
your opponent to use all his orbs.</i>

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:24.690
<i>And...</i>

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:28.340
<i>Now you're on the offensive!</i>

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:31.280
<i>Don't think about his counterattack.</i>

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:34.020
<i>Finish him in a single blow!</i>

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:42.100
<i>He had more than one wall?!</i>

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:45.630
I commend you on breaking Chifunju's wall.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.250
But now...

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:50.350
You're finished!

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.960
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.920
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:08.010
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious</i>

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:11.930
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:16.060
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:20.150
<i>Cute, cute girl</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.030
<i>She has such a calm face</i>

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:27.950
<i>But with her giant shovel, 
she goes from one hill to the next</i>

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.530
<i>And fills them with holes</i>

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>I don’t know where she came from</i>

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:39.630
<i>But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you</i>

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:43.750
<i>She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying</i>

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:47.550
<i>She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid</i>

00:22:48.180 --> 00:22:51.680
<i>Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine</i>

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>This dignified girl is never scared</i>

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:59.730
<i>She works hard all night burying</i>

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.900
<i>She buries others in order to survive</i>

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:08.150
<i>The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.030
<i>The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through</i>

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.910
<i>There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious</i>

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:20.000
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers</i>

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:22.750
<i>But I don’t want any if you 
don’t have red peppers...</i>

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:25.090
<i>I don’t, I don’t, I don’t!</i>

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:27.170
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:28.510
I can't count on the youngster 
to handle this anymore!

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:30.980
